WEBVTT

01:38.180 --> 01:41.039
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.070 --> 01:44.000
[Episode 32]

01:44.430 --> 01:46.030
Are you blaming your father?

01:47.950 --> 01:48.560
Xuanye,

01:49.000 --> 01:49.560
things were not

01:49.560 --> 01:50.789
as you imagine.

01:51.590 --> 01:52.590
Your father had been

01:52.590 --> 01:54.050
protecting you all along.

01:58.509 --> 01:59.509
Twelve years ago,

02:00.920 --> 02:03.530
I encountered an accident in the Underground City.

02:03.530 --> 02:05.060
Your father came to find me,

02:06.260 --> 02:08.030
but coincidentally met you.

02:23.590 --> 02:24.190
Wake up!

02:28.079 --> 02:29.680
My father was a demon hunter.

02:30.150 --> 02:30.960
Why couldn't he recognize

02:30.960 --> 02:31.930
I am a demon?

02:33.520 --> 02:34.030
Because

02:35.710 --> 02:37.360
you have extraordinary talent

02:37.360 --> 02:39.030
and your demonic power is strong.

02:39.030 --> 02:41.470
Without special methods, no one could see through you.

02:41.470 --> 02:42.140
So your father

02:42.140 --> 02:43.610
didn't suspect you.

02:45.260 --> 02:46.590
Moreover, at that time,

02:47.280 --> 02:49.400
you were severely injured internally

02:49.400 --> 02:51.430
and had forgotten your own identity.

02:51.430 --> 02:52.280
So your father

02:52.840 --> 02:54.300
took you in and raised you.

02:55.280 --> 02:56.079
And that,

02:56.960 --> 02:58.220
lasted for four years.

02:59.870 --> 03:00.630
And Xuanye,

03:01.800 --> 03:03.630
your talent is extremely strong.

03:03.630 --> 03:04.230
You're more suited

03:04.230 --> 03:05.700
to practise magical tricks than your elder brother.

03:05.700 --> 03:07.120
Your father was initially very happy,

03:07.120 --> 03:08.020
thinking he had found

03:08.020 --> 03:08.800
a genius who could inherit

03:08.800 --> 03:09.960
his skills.

03:10.400 --> 03:11.000
Hence,

03:11.560 --> 03:13.760
he taught you all of his magical tricks.

03:14.710 --> 03:16.770
But unexpectedly, four years later,

03:17.470 --> 03:20.310
when you went demon hunting with him for the first time,

03:20.310 --> 03:21.840
he discovered the truth.

03:56.700 --> 03:57.260
Son,

03:57.560 --> 03:58.560
demon hunting...

04:02.260 --> 04:03.980
After discovering you are a demon,

04:03.980 --> 04:06.680
your father initially struggled

04:07.710 --> 04:08.590
and suffered.

04:10.560 --> 04:12.890
But in the end, he still loved you too much.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.410
He couldn't let you go.

04:15.800 --> 04:16.680
So,

04:17.390 --> 04:19.019
he created the Peerless Bracelet,

04:19.019 --> 04:20.329
hoping to use it to seal

04:20.360 --> 04:21.290
your demon form.

04:22.010 --> 04:25.120
But in the end, man's plans are no match for heaven's will.

04:25.120 --> 04:25.830
Xuanye,

04:27.040 --> 04:28.120
your father had already

04:28.120 --> 04:29.780
tried his best to protect you.

04:30.920 --> 04:32.070
No one is perfect.

04:33.520 --> 04:34.670
Don't blame him.

04:37.000 --> 04:37.770
Xuanye,

04:39.680 --> 04:41.080
I don't know

04:43.480 --> 04:44.730
what's best

04:46.350 --> 04:47.990
for you.

04:50.510 --> 04:52.870
I'm afraid I've made a mistake.

04:54.380 --> 04:56.290
You're still seriously injured right now.

04:56.290 --> 04:57.630
There's no use in overthinking.

04:57.630 --> 04:58.430
Plus, there are officials

04:58.430 --> 04:59.920
still trying to catch you out there.

04:59.920 --> 05:00.480
Stay here

05:00.760 --> 05:02.160
and recover peacefully.

05:03.240 --> 05:05.150
You've suffered severe internal injuries.

05:05.150 --> 05:06.280
Those demon hunters

05:06.390 --> 05:07.360
were too brutal.

05:15.030 --> 05:15.760
This is

05:16.230 --> 05:17.220
Yuyuan Soup.

05:17.830 --> 05:19.000
It helps to regulate your inner energy

05:19.000 --> 05:20.730
and clear your mind and spirit.

05:24.640 --> 05:25.920
I've noticed that after your transformation,

05:25.920 --> 05:27.070
you've been restless

05:27.070 --> 05:28.560
and hard to control yourself.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.600
This medicine might help to

05:30.600 --> 05:31.700
alleviate it a bit.

05:32.070 --> 05:33.510
Before you're completely stable,

05:33.510 --> 05:34.510
you must remember

05:34.930 --> 05:35.860
to take it daily.

05:38.510 --> 05:39.070
Alright.

05:48.820 --> 05:49.700
Oh, Uncle,

05:50.880 --> 05:51.710
why can't I

05:51.740 --> 05:53.330
control my beast form?

05:56.070 --> 05:57.200
I don't know either.

05:58.430 --> 05:59.630
It may be because you were

05:59.630 --> 06:01.600
confined by the Peerless Bracelet for years.

06:01.600 --> 06:03.190
Once you transformed into a demon,

06:03.190 --> 06:04.320
you couldn't adapt.

06:07.190 --> 06:07.800
Xuanye,

06:10.560 --> 06:12.040
I have a question for you.

06:12.750 --> 06:13.950
Now that you know

06:13.950 --> 06:15.080
your true identity,

06:15.270 --> 06:16.330
what are your plans

06:17.000 --> 06:18.120
for the future?

06:21.750 --> 06:22.880
I don't know either.

06:24.120 --> 06:26.380
I thought about leaving for good before,

06:26.680 --> 06:28.340
so I don't burden her anymore.

06:28.480 --> 06:29.610
"Don't burden her"?

06:31.200 --> 06:32.790
You say that so easily.

06:33.310 --> 06:34.640
But have you considered

06:35.040 --> 06:36.070
that the person left behind

06:36.070 --> 06:37.130
might not be happy,

06:37.560 --> 06:39.120
and might not be able to

06:39.490 --> 06:41.020
start a new life as you wish?

06:44.070 --> 06:44.720
So,

06:46.350 --> 06:47.860
I'm asking you seriously,

06:48.950 --> 06:49.750
in the future,

06:50.970 --> 06:52.290
do you want to be a human

06:53.630 --> 06:54.830
or a demon?

07:45.390 --> 07:47.650
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

07:48.000 --> 07:49.330
You were waiting for us?

07:49.750 --> 07:50.650
To be precise,

07:50.909 --> 07:52.440
I was waiting for Miss Duan.

07:53.070 --> 07:54.120
How is Xuanye now?

07:55.120 --> 07:57.190
My master has been taking care of him.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.270
Let me ask you seriously,

08:10.890 --> 08:13.450
in the future, do you want to be human

08:14.750 --> 08:16.070
or a demon?

08:18.920 --> 08:19.470
Jiu,

08:19.920 --> 08:21.380
someone is here to see you.

08:33.960 --> 08:34.630
Xuanye.

08:47.530 --> 08:48.840
Are you alright?

08:50.540 --> 08:51.210
I'm fine.

08:52.270 --> 08:54.270
You're lying. How could you be fine?

08:54.720 --> 08:56.120
Are you hurt anywhere?

08:57.300 --> 08:58.150
I'm okay.

08:59.450 --> 09:00.380
Why are you here?

09:01.240 --> 09:02.900
Did they give you any trouble?

09:04.630 --> 09:05.350
No.

09:06.370 --> 09:08.430
it was Miss Sima and Chief Constable Chu

09:08.430 --> 09:10.070
who rescued me from jail.

09:13.320 --> 09:14.120
Thank you all.

09:14.320 --> 09:14.840
Xuanye,

09:15.630 --> 09:17.290
you don't need to be so formal.

09:17.960 --> 09:18.420
We know

09:18.450 --> 09:19.580
your nature is kind.

09:20.540 --> 09:21.740
There are bad people,

09:22.000 --> 09:23.660
and there are good demons too.

09:29.600 --> 09:30.200
Xuanye,

09:33.150 --> 09:34.750
we've brought Chi Xue to you.

09:46.910 --> 09:49.000
Xuanye, will he obey?

09:49.790 --> 09:50.990
Let's see how it goes.

09:51.550 --> 09:52.550
If he doesn't behave,

09:52.550 --> 09:54.880
there are ways to deal with disobedience.

09:56.330 --> 09:57.130
Any news about

09:57.140 --> 09:58.200
the panther demon?

09:58.240 --> 09:58.870
Yes,

09:59.400 --> 10:01.150
but he's very alert,

10:01.180 --> 10:02.910
and his powers are formidable.

10:03.240 --> 10:03.900
I...

10:04.430 --> 10:06.760
I'm not confident I can capture him alive.

10:07.980 --> 10:08.770
Forget it.

10:11.360 --> 10:12.760
None of that matters now.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.650
Now that we have Xuanye,

10:15.120 --> 10:16.120
that panther demon

10:16.120 --> 10:17.390
isn't important anymore.

10:17.390 --> 10:18.440
Capture him if you can,

10:18.440 --> 10:19.720
if not, just kill him.

10:21.360 --> 10:21.840
Yes.

10:22.270 --> 10:22.910
We can't let him ruin

10:22.910 --> 10:23.770
our grand plan.

10:24.780 --> 10:25.580
Have some tea.

10:25.910 --> 10:26.550
Master,

10:27.790 --> 10:29.790
there's something I don't quite understand.

10:29.790 --> 10:30.790
Didn't you say...

10:34.220 --> 10:35.290
Didn't you say

10:35.790 --> 10:36.440
the Realm Gate that opens

10:36.440 --> 10:37.720
once every twelve years

10:37.720 --> 10:38.550
is the only passage

10:38.550 --> 10:40.270
between the human and demon worlds?

10:40.270 --> 10:41.120
Then how did

10:41.150 --> 10:42.680
that panther demon get out?

10:48.760 --> 10:49.570
This is how.

10:50.770 --> 10:51.750
The Mystic Panther clan

10:51.750 --> 10:54.150
has guarded the Realm Gates for generations.

10:54.150 --> 10:54.800
I suppose

10:54.900 --> 10:56.400
they have some special means

10:56.400 --> 10:57.510
that allow them to move freely

10:57.510 --> 10:58.840
between the two worlds.

10:59.360 --> 11:00.200
However, such means

11:00.200 --> 11:01.860
must have great limitations.

11:02.270 --> 11:03.750
Otherwise, they would have come out long ago,

11:03.750 --> 11:05.390
and not only one of them did.

11:07.180 --> 11:08.710
Is he Xuanye's family then?

11:09.360 --> 11:11.360
At least they're from the same clan.

11:14.240 --> 11:14.870
Master,

11:15.630 --> 11:18.430
we can't delay treating your sickness any longer.

11:18.840 --> 11:19.640
It's alright.

11:21.380 --> 11:22.640
I have my own plans.

11:24.520 --> 11:28.610
[Sky Cavern]

11:41.790 --> 11:43.250
I'm the one who harmed him.

11:44.960 --> 11:45.870
Xuanye.

11:47.840 --> 11:48.940
Chi Xue grew up

11:49.240 --> 11:50.510
in the Ganshan Clinic.

11:52.030 --> 11:53.760
My father took good care of him.

11:55.910 --> 11:57.110
But after I took over,

11:59.200 --> 12:00.910
he never had a good day.

12:04.830 --> 12:07.760
For the first two years after my parents passed away,

12:08.630 --> 12:09.640
I hated demons,

12:11.630 --> 12:13.560
and wasn't very nice to him either.

12:15.840 --> 12:16.990
Although later,

12:18.010 --> 12:19.810
I gradually came to understand,

12:21.670 --> 12:22.960
but I still had nothing good

12:22.960 --> 12:23.840
to offer him.

12:28.260 --> 12:29.990
Chi Xue had the heart of a child.

12:31.120 --> 12:31.980
He was playful,

12:32.270 --> 12:33.240
and loved to eat.

12:35.270 --> 12:37.470
His martial arts skills were mediocre,

12:37.990 --> 12:39.120
and he was very lazy.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.210
I couldn't stand his laziness,

12:42.230 --> 12:43.830
so I was very strict with him.

12:45.270 --> 12:47.270
Life at the Ganshan Clinic was poor.

12:48.740 --> 12:49.740
Little attention

12:50.630 --> 12:52.630
was paid to fancy food and clothing.

12:54.320 --> 12:55.340
That's how

12:56.870 --> 12:58.270
he foolishly followed me

13:00.510 --> 13:01.850
year after year.

13:09.270 --> 13:11.000
When my mother was still alive,

13:11.840 --> 13:13.900
during spring and autumn festivals,

13:14.540 --> 13:16.670
she would always make him new clothes.

13:18.160 --> 13:19.200
But with me...

13:24.080 --> 13:24.910
I hadn't bought him

13:24.910 --> 13:26.440
new clothes for a long time.

13:28.840 --> 13:29.640
You know what?

13:31.150 --> 13:33.280
On the day of our engagement ceremony,

13:33.420 --> 13:35.280
I saw that his pants were all torn.

13:37.560 --> 13:39.620
I thought about buying him a new pair.

13:42.200 --> 13:43.530
But I never expected...

13:53.090 --> 13:54.030
Xuanye.

13:58.250 --> 13:59.000
Anyway,

14:01.840 --> 14:02.910
I've let him down.

14:04.470 --> 14:06.540
Don't be too sad.

14:08.970 --> 14:10.230
This isn't your fault.

14:11.020 --> 14:12.500
It was those two demon hunters

14:12.500 --> 14:13.540
who killed him.

14:14.870 --> 14:17.000
Chi Xue was also trying to protect you.

14:19.020 --> 14:19.710
I think,

14:20.270 --> 14:21.820
if it were you,

14:22.680 --> 14:24.260
you would also risk your life

14:24.260 --> 14:25.920
to protect him, wouldn't you?

14:31.550 --> 14:32.610
By the way, Banxia,

14:35.550 --> 14:37.190
when did you

14:37.600 --> 14:38.800
find out I was a demon?

14:47.910 --> 14:49.120
When I first saw

14:49.140 --> 14:50.560
your wound,

14:50.960 --> 14:52.440
I had some suspicions.

14:53.990 --> 14:55.450
But it was at the Underground City

14:55.450 --> 14:56.650
where I confirmed it.

15:01.010 --> 15:01.780
That early?

15:05.670 --> 15:06.320
Xuanye,

15:06.720 --> 15:10.340
♫Just sobered up after a dream, sighing for my life♫

15:07.870 --> 15:09.030
I know it

15:09.030 --> 15:09.960
was my fault,

15:09.960 --> 15:11.840
I didn't explain it clearly to you.

15:10.360 --> 15:13.230
♫In this desolate mortal world♫

15:12.960 --> 15:13.600
But...

15:13.920 --> 15:16.260
♫The other side sees fantasies fading into obscurity♫

15:14.360 --> 15:16.000
But I was just afraid.

15:16.280 --> 15:20.050
♫Is it a blessing or a calamity?♫

15:16.690 --> 15:18.200
I was afraid you couldn't accept it.

15:18.200 --> 15:19.200
I was afraid you'd say

15:19.200 --> 15:20.600
that we, human and demon, walk different paths.

15:20.600 --> 15:21.270
So...

15:22.400 --> 15:24.350
♫I'm all alone♫

15:22.930 --> 15:24.000
I don't blame you.

15:24.380 --> 15:26.250
♫Braving the snowstorm♫

15:26.270 --> 15:28.930
♫Struck by sudden amnesia♫

15:28.960 --> 15:29.840
I understand it all.

15:29.640 --> 15:32.050
♫Wait until the last peach blossom falls♫

15:32.080 --> 15:39.950
♫Glance back with love for 10,000 years♫

15:39.790 --> 15:40.630
This

15:39.950 --> 15:41.940
♫If there were no regrets♫

15:41.590 --> 15:42.640
was all my fault.

15:42.030 --> 15:44.020
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

15:44.040 --> 15:47.030
♫To illuminate the world?♫

15:44.510 --> 15:45.770
Who would have thought

15:46.480 --> 15:47.550
that a demon hunter

15:47.400 --> 15:51.030
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

15:48.200 --> 15:50.200
would turn out to be a demon himself?

15:51.630 --> 15:55.280
♫Before daybreak♫

15:54.390 --> 15:55.200
These days,

15:55.370 --> 15:57.310
♫May you have no regrets♫

15:57.330 --> 15:58.900
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

15:57.390 --> 15:58.150
I've calmed down

15:58.150 --> 15:59.240
and thought carefully

15:58.930 --> 16:02.770
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

15:59.270 --> 16:00.670
about what I said before.

16:03.160 --> 16:05.390
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

16:03.900 --> 16:04.960
What a joke.

16:05.440 --> 16:07.300
♫If we luck out♫

16:07.320 --> 16:13.090
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

16:07.550 --> 16:09.600
Don't talk about yourself like that.

16:09.600 --> 16:10.440
Whether one is a demon or human,

16:10.440 --> 16:11.960
does it matter that much?

16:13.320 --> 16:14.550
Chi Xue is also a demon,

16:14.550 --> 16:16.550
don't you treat him like family too?

16:16.910 --> 16:18.110
And there's Chilian,

16:18.440 --> 16:19.720
isn't he a hundred,

16:19.750 --> 16:21.660
a thousand times better than Xingxian?

16:21.660 --> 16:23.030
You are who you are.

16:24.910 --> 16:28.270
You punish evil, promote good, and are always willing to help others.

16:28.270 --> 16:29.140
You protect me,

16:29.190 --> 16:30.670
protect those around you,

16:31.160 --> 16:33.090
and bless the people of Guangping.

16:38.000 --> 16:39.120
Remember this.

16:42.320 --> 16:43.360
As a human,

16:44.630 --> 16:45.550
you're Xuanye.

16:48.800 --> 16:50.680
As a demon, you're still Xuanye.

16:56.270 --> 16:58.080
You're the one I wholeheartedly love,

16:58.080 --> 16:59.200
and want to marry.

17:00.030 --> 17:01.480
This will not be changed,

17:01.810 --> 17:03.010
nor can it be changed.

17:03.320 --> 17:05.180
But do you know how dangerous it is

17:05.829 --> 17:06.560
to be with me?

17:08.089 --> 17:08.790
I don't care.

17:08.790 --> 17:10.270
I just want to be with you.

17:13.470 --> 17:14.940
Don't ever think about making me leave,

17:14.940 --> 17:15.960
nor think of saying

17:15.960 --> 17:17.030
high-sounding words

17:16.020 --> 17:17.950
♫If there were no regrets♫

17:17.050 --> 17:18.569
and then disappear yourself.

17:17.970 --> 17:19.970
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

17:19.109 --> 17:19.920
If you dare to leave,

17:19.920 --> 17:21.030
I dare to go find you.

17:20.000 --> 17:22.589
♫To illuminate the world?♫

17:21.530 --> 17:22.400
If you go to the desert,

17:22.400 --> 17:23.680
I'll accompany you to the desert.

17:23.369 --> 17:27.060
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

17:23.930 --> 17:24.550
If you go to the grasslands,

17:24.550 --> 17:26.490
I'll go to the grasslands to find you.

17:26.490 --> 17:27.970
If I can't find you forever,

17:27.720 --> 17:31.430
♫Before daybreak♫

17:28.000 --> 17:28.590
I don't mind

17:28.590 --> 17:29.590
living like a beggar

17:29.590 --> 17:30.480
at all.

17:31.450 --> 17:33.140
♫May you have no regrets♫

17:31.480 --> 17:32.590
Anyway, I will never

17:32.590 --> 17:33.070
listen to you

17:33.070 --> 17:34.400
to stay behind to live a good life.

17:33.180 --> 17:34.520
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

17:34.400 --> 17:35.200
Do you hear me?

17:34.550 --> 17:38.780
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

17:39.170 --> 17:41.520
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

17:41.550 --> 17:43.180
♫If we luck out♫

17:43.230 --> 17:50.340
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

17:56.440 --> 18:01.010
[Wugeng Inn]

17:58.620 --> 17:59.910
You haven't told me

18:02.160 --> 18:03.960
the reason why you don't stay at the Sky Cavern.

18:03.960 --> 18:04.820
I don't like it.

18:05.200 --> 18:06.200
You don't like it?

18:06.920 --> 18:07.480
Why?

18:10.030 --> 18:11.320
That uncle of Xuanye's

18:12.270 --> 18:13.930
makes me feel uncomfortable.

18:15.480 --> 18:16.410
Uncomfortable?

18:19.970 --> 18:20.790
Do you know why my official position

18:20.790 --> 18:21.830
rose so quickly?

18:24.820 --> 18:26.440
Your father is the current Grand Secretary.

18:26.440 --> 18:28.900
Your mother is the Empress Dowager's niece.

18:29.440 --> 18:30.240
Not just that.

18:32.000 --> 18:34.550
Your brother is the Junior Tutor to the Crown Prince.

18:34.550 --> 18:35.790
You want to fight, don't you?

18:35.790 --> 18:36.390
Of course.

18:37.590 --> 18:38.640
This is inseparable from the Commissioner's

18:38.640 --> 18:39.440
own efforts.

18:40.110 --> 18:41.200
After all, not everyone

18:41.200 --> 18:42.730
has such a good background.

18:48.750 --> 18:49.270
Let go.

18:56.070 --> 18:56.600
Alright.

18:57.310 --> 18:57.960
Go on.

19:01.080 --> 19:02.590
I trust my intuition very much,

19:02.590 --> 19:03.760
and it's very accurate.

19:03.760 --> 19:05.560
Whether a person is good or evil,

19:05.750 --> 19:06.480
with one look,

19:06.480 --> 19:07.880
I can tell it about right.

19:10.340 --> 19:11.470
You, Commissioner,

19:12.160 --> 19:13.490
are really impressive.

19:15.340 --> 19:16.340
Believe it or not.

19:25.160 --> 19:25.680
Come.

19:26.040 --> 19:27.440
Have some while it's hot.

19:27.680 --> 19:28.540
I'm not hungry.

19:29.030 --> 19:30.790
You should eat something even if you're not hungry.

19:30.790 --> 19:31.270
Hasn't it been two days

19:31.270 --> 19:32.930
since you've eaten anything?

19:33.270 --> 19:34.330
You're not a demon.

19:34.440 --> 19:36.100
How can you go without eating?

19:36.110 --> 19:37.720
Can demons go without food?

19:39.920 --> 19:40.770
I don't know.

19:41.960 --> 19:42.950
I only know that

19:43.120 --> 19:45.010
I have rich experience in catching demons,

19:45.010 --> 19:47.410
but only a few days of experience being one.

19:47.810 --> 19:49.250
Let me figure it out first.

19:49.250 --> 19:50.550
Once I've figured it out,

19:50.550 --> 19:51.550
I'll let you know.

19:52.540 --> 19:54.940
You should also get a bowl and chopsticks and eat up.

19:54.940 --> 19:55.800
I'm not eating.

19:55.850 --> 19:56.980
You go ahead and eat.

19:58.270 --> 19:59.300
Just take a bite.

19:59.400 --> 20:01.130
I can't finish it all by myself.

20:13.960 --> 20:14.920
By the way, Banxia,

20:14.920 --> 20:16.680
you were shot by an arrow earlier.

20:16.680 --> 20:17.880
How does it feel now?

20:20.200 --> 20:21.380
Miss Sima has already

20:21.380 --> 20:22.350
bandaged it for me.

20:22.350 --> 20:23.150
It's fine now.

20:23.410 --> 20:24.110
You lost so much blood.

20:24.110 --> 20:25.710
Is just bandaging it enough?

20:26.120 --> 20:27.320
That can't be enough.

20:27.610 --> 20:28.470
Give me your arm.

20:28.470 --> 20:29.330
Let me check it.

20:29.930 --> 20:30.690
I told you

20:30.720 --> 20:31.750
it's fine now.

20:35.880 --> 20:36.750
Does it hurt?

20:42.200 --> 20:42.750
It hurts.

20:44.100 --> 20:45.140
It hurts a lot.

20:45.680 --> 20:46.880
It's really painful.

20:54.890 --> 20:55.940
I'm just kidding.

20:56.270 --> 20:58.200
It stopped hurting a long time ago.

21:01.140 --> 21:02.600
You were so badly injured.

21:02.800 --> 21:04.000
How could it not hurt?

21:04.840 --> 21:06.740
The situation was so urgent at that time.

21:06.740 --> 21:07.870
You were taken away.

21:08.000 --> 21:10.930
How would I have time to think whether it hurts or not?

21:12.110 --> 21:13.370
You're still so silly,

21:13.750 --> 21:15.200
just like when you were little.

21:15.200 --> 21:16.340
How do you know?

21:18.900 --> 21:20.050
Do you remember now?

21:22.240 --> 21:23.030
I just vaguely

21:23.030 --> 21:24.290
remember some things,

21:24.590 --> 21:25.850
but it's not complete.

21:28.270 --> 21:28.830
Banxia,

21:30.100 --> 21:31.540
can you tell me

21:32.200 --> 21:33.000
how you

21:33.160 --> 21:35.220
entered the Carefree Land back then?

21:38.480 --> 21:40.440
Haven't I told you before?

21:40.830 --> 21:43.120
When I was little, I was taken away by a child trafficker.

21:43.120 --> 21:44.110
Then they took me to a

21:44.110 --> 21:45.510
a dark and unknown place.

21:45.550 --> 21:47.440
It must have been the Underground City.

21:47.440 --> 21:49.000
Then I ran away.

21:49.480 --> 21:50.720
I ran and ran,

21:51.200 --> 21:52.920
and somehow

21:53.440 --> 21:55.400
I ended up in what you call

21:55.750 --> 21:56.810
the Carefree Land.

21:56.960 --> 21:58.310
That's where I met you.

22:04.440 --> 22:05.880
So from where

22:05.960 --> 22:07.760
did you enter the Carefree Land?

22:09.160 --> 22:10.890
I can't remember that clearly.

22:11.240 --> 22:12.270
All I know is

22:12.290 --> 22:14.350
after we fell off the cliff together,

22:14.650 --> 22:16.620
I woke up and I was already at home.

22:17.070 --> 22:18.640
My Father found me.

22:19.270 --> 22:20.120
What about you?

22:20.120 --> 22:21.210
When I woke up,

22:21.240 --> 22:23.240
I was already at the Ganshan Clinic.

22:23.280 --> 22:24.060
My father was in the

22:24.060 --> 22:25.350
dark river of the Underground City

22:25.350 --> 22:26.280
when he found me.

22:26.400 --> 22:27.130
I'm guessing

22:27.160 --> 22:28.030
after we fell into

22:28.030 --> 22:29.070
the Carefree Land,

22:29.070 --> 22:30.200
we followed the dark river

22:30.200 --> 22:32.130
to arrive at the Underground City.

22:32.470 --> 22:34.400
I was severely injured at that time

22:34.550 --> 22:36.550
and couldn't remember many things.

22:37.160 --> 22:37.980
After that,

22:38.900 --> 22:40.420
my parents adopted me.

22:42.880 --> 22:43.590
Here.

22:44.920 --> 22:45.580
Take a look.

22:48.750 --> 22:49.810
You must be hungry.

22:50.070 --> 22:51.270
Come on, eat quickly.

22:52.160 --> 22:53.090
Go ahead and eat.

22:58.750 --> 22:59.880
Try the chicken leg,

23:00.310 --> 23:01.440
it's very fragrant.

23:13.030 --> 23:14.030
Four years later,

23:14.350 --> 23:16.200
my father discovered I was a demon.

23:16.200 --> 23:17.640
Unable to bring himself to kill me,

23:17.640 --> 23:18.480
he used the Peerless Bracelet

23:18.480 --> 23:19.680
to seal my demon form.

23:20.750 --> 23:21.350
Moreover,

23:21.750 --> 23:22.400
he never allowed me

23:22.400 --> 23:24.730
to learn demon hunting techniques again.

23:26.310 --> 23:27.510
I see.

23:28.510 --> 23:30.590
That means when we entered the null,

23:30.790 --> 23:32.750
the Peerless Bracelet became tangible,

23:32.750 --> 23:34.210
which is why it shattered.

23:34.990 --> 23:36.590
Your father must've prevented you from

23:36.590 --> 23:38.440
coming to the Underground City because of this.

23:38.440 --> 23:38.960
He not only

23:38.960 --> 23:40.920
forbade me from going to the Underground City,

23:40.920 --> 23:43.070
but also prevented me from becoming a demon hunter.

23:43.070 --> 23:44.000
After his death,

23:44.400 --> 23:45.750
I deeply hated demons

23:46.410 --> 23:47.620
and took my father's Hidden Dragon Case

23:47.620 --> 23:49.150
to hunt demons everywhere.

23:49.790 --> 23:51.590
It was Chi Xue who enlightened me

23:51.880 --> 23:53.010
and made me remember

23:53.520 --> 23:54.310
what my father said

23:54.310 --> 23:55.480
to me before he died.

23:55.920 --> 23:57.380
People can be good or evil,

23:58.510 --> 24:00.110
and the same goes for demons.

24:05.240 --> 24:06.370
Even if your parents

24:07.110 --> 24:08.070
and brother

24:09.750 --> 24:11.210
were all killed by demons,

24:12.710 --> 24:14.040
you can't let hatred

24:14.070 --> 24:15.400
blind your eyes.

24:17.030 --> 24:20.200
Don't kill indiscriminately without distinguishing right from wrong.

24:20.200 --> 24:21.260
Do you understand?

24:22.050 --> 24:23.410
So that's how it was.

24:24.200 --> 24:26.270
After I learned you were a demon,

24:26.830 --> 24:28.440
I even blamed your father.

24:29.090 --> 24:30.550
But thinking about it now,

24:31.160 --> 24:33.020
he actually had good intentions.

24:35.880 --> 24:36.480
I know.

24:39.590 --> 24:40.270
Xuanye,

24:42.770 --> 24:43.840
I'm sorry.

24:45.030 --> 24:46.790
If it weren't for me,

24:47.300 --> 24:49.720
you wouldn't need to come to the Underground City

24:49.720 --> 24:52.180
and you wouldn't have experienced all this.

24:53.310 --> 24:55.600
There's a purpose in everything that happens.

24:55.600 --> 24:56.550
I couldn't have remained

24:56.550 --> 24:57.680
in the dark forever.

25:07.790 --> 25:08.390
By the way,

25:08.920 --> 25:09.750
how did you know about

25:09.750 --> 25:10.960
the scars on my body?

25:11.160 --> 25:12.690
Did you take off my clothes?

25:12.960 --> 25:13.880
At that time,

25:14.240 --> 25:14.960
the two of us

25:14.960 --> 25:16.090
weren't that close.

25:19.620 --> 25:22.170
That was so long ago.

25:22.200 --> 25:24.030
Why are you suddenly bringing this up?

25:24.030 --> 25:25.440
I just suddenly feel

25:25.830 --> 25:27.690
that I don't know you well enough.

25:28.040 --> 25:28.800
If I rashly

25:28.830 --> 25:29.960
marry you like this,

25:30.310 --> 25:32.040
I'm afraid I won't feel at ease.

25:36.200 --> 25:37.600
Why are you so surprised?

25:37.790 --> 25:38.960
After what you said,

25:39.110 --> 25:40.440
how could I abandon you?

25:40.510 --> 25:41.310
Did I really make you

25:41.310 --> 25:42.170
become a beggar

25:42.270 --> 25:44.270
and search for me all over the world?

25:51.110 --> 25:52.510
Why are you crying again?

25:54.510 --> 25:55.920
You promised me.

25:56.160 --> 25:56.960
You promised me,

25:56.960 --> 25:57.720
so make sure

25:57.740 --> 25:59.990
you don't leave me again.

26:00.200 --> 26:01.880
You're a man of your words.

26:01.900 --> 26:02.920
You must keep your promises.

26:02.920 --> 26:03.790
Did you hear me?

26:04.440 --> 26:05.070
Alright.

26:06.070 --> 26:06.800
But, Banxia,

26:08.240 --> 26:09.240
before you came,

26:10.110 --> 26:11.840
I thought about a lot of things.

26:12.480 --> 26:13.590
I thought about you,

26:13.590 --> 26:14.440
about Chi Xue,

26:15.310 --> 26:16.200
about myself,

26:16.750 --> 26:17.720
about my father.

26:18.240 --> 26:19.700
My thoughts were in chaos.

26:19.920 --> 26:21.400
I didn't know where to begin.

26:21.400 --> 26:24.000
But even though I haven't figured it out yet...

26:25.310 --> 26:26.050
I haven't figured out

26:26.050 --> 26:28.050
how I should live my life from now on,

26:28.590 --> 26:29.550
I haven't figured out

26:29.550 --> 26:31.680
which path I should take in the future,

26:32.370 --> 26:33.830
but I can promise you this.

26:35.240 --> 26:36.880
No matter what plans I make,

26:37.890 --> 26:39.750
I will always include you in them.

26:40.070 --> 26:40.720
Okay?

27:21.510 --> 27:22.360
Master,

27:25.020 --> 27:26.510
as a government official,

27:27.110 --> 27:29.000
you collude with demons

27:30.350 --> 27:31.790
and lure us here.

27:32.310 --> 27:34.310
Can you face your official uniform?

27:35.280 --> 27:37.340
I'm not wearing my official uniform.

27:37.510 --> 27:38.840
Thus, my identity today

27:38.870 --> 27:39.930
is not an official,

27:40.880 --> 27:42.000
but Jiu Xuanye

27:42.680 --> 27:43.880
and Chi Xue's friend.

27:44.400 --> 27:45.480
I, Jiang Shangyun,

27:46.350 --> 27:47.280
have only killed

27:47.790 --> 27:48.750
demons.

27:50.750 --> 27:51.880
You killed Chi Xue.

27:52.400 --> 27:53.800
I should have killed you.

27:54.920 --> 27:56.380
But you're a demon hunter,

27:56.440 --> 27:57.300
and I'm a demon.

27:58.070 --> 27:59.110
You mistakenly believed

27:59.110 --> 28:00.510
that I harmed that child,

28:00.790 --> 28:02.350
so you acted ruthlessly against me.

28:02.350 --> 28:03.810
It's all understandable.

28:04.160 --> 28:05.220
So I won't kill you.

28:05.880 --> 28:07.340
But you're too impulsive.

28:07.830 --> 28:09.640
Several times, without distinguishing right from wrong,

28:09.640 --> 28:10.840
you were quick to act.

28:11.310 --> 28:13.000
People who can't think clearly

28:13.000 --> 28:14.600
don't deserve to have power.

28:15.030 --> 28:17.090
So I've nullified your cultivation.

28:17.110 --> 28:19.570
I hope you'll be more cautious in the future.

28:19.750 --> 28:20.790
If you kill recklessly again

28:20.790 --> 28:22.050
and fall into my hands,

28:22.790 --> 28:24.160
I won't show mercy.

28:30.550 --> 28:31.110
Master.

28:31.400 --> 28:32.040
Let's go.

28:50.100 --> 28:51.180
I thought

28:52.290 --> 28:53.420
you would kill them.

28:54.750 --> 28:55.950
Would you allow that?

28:59.110 --> 29:00.310
Logically speaking,

29:00.500 --> 29:02.110
we should detain them first,

29:02.600 --> 29:04.660
then write a petition and go to court.

29:05.070 --> 29:06.160
But Lord Geng

29:06.500 --> 29:08.630
doesn't seem to want to question them.

29:09.070 --> 29:11.530
'A life for a life' is a universal principle,

29:11.550 --> 29:13.950
but how should we deal with killing demons?

29:14.550 --> 29:16.160
The law doesn't cover this.

29:22.220 --> 29:23.150
Are you alright?

29:24.960 --> 29:25.720
I'm fine.

29:27.160 --> 29:28.360
Let's head back then.

29:34.740 --> 29:35.750
They didn't catch up, did they?

29:35.750 --> 29:37.410
They didn't catch up, Master.

29:37.940 --> 29:38.740
Wait a moment.

29:46.510 --> 29:47.640
How are you, Master?

29:47.780 --> 29:48.580
It's nothing.

29:50.750 --> 29:51.480
Master,

29:51.880 --> 29:53.270
the person who saved him before

29:53.270 --> 29:54.750
seems to be the owner of Sky Cavern.

29:54.750 --> 29:55.480
I know.

29:56.440 --> 29:57.270
Then why didn't you say anything?

29:57.270 --> 29:57.920
Say what?

29:58.720 --> 30:00.850
They're obviously working together.

30:01.510 --> 30:03.680
The Sky Cavern is powerful and wealthy.

30:03.680 --> 30:06.030
If there's anyone to blame, it's us both

30:06.030 --> 30:07.490
for being so blind before.

30:07.950 --> 30:09.470
But fortunes change.

30:09.960 --> 30:10.960
In this world,

30:11.410 --> 30:12.570
there isn't just one demon-catching sect

30:12.570 --> 30:14.170
being the Eight Pillar Sect.

30:15.070 --> 30:16.000
Sooner or later!

30:16.240 --> 30:17.550
Sooner or later, I will...

30:17.550 --> 30:19.350
Why are you two in such a mess?

30:23.270 --> 30:24.000
Manager Lyu

30:24.960 --> 30:26.620
Manager Lyu, why are you here?

30:26.920 --> 30:27.640
Naturally, I'm here to look for you,

30:27.640 --> 30:28.750
Daoist Jiang.

30:29.720 --> 30:30.350
Disciple,

30:30.880 --> 30:31.510
let's go.

30:32.400 --> 30:33.550
Daoist Jiang, why do you seem

30:33.550 --> 30:34.950
to be on guard against me?

30:35.510 --> 30:36.540
We've known each other for years,

30:36.540 --> 30:38.350
and our business has been ongoing.

30:38.350 --> 30:39.480
I've always thought

30:39.490 --> 30:40.580
we were friends.

30:43.540 --> 30:44.440
I've also always thought

30:44.440 --> 30:45.770
we were on the same path.

30:46.420 --> 30:48.820
That day when your master saved the panther demon,

30:48.820 --> 30:50.360
I thought you would kill him,

30:50.360 --> 30:51.550
but you let him go.

30:52.240 --> 30:52.830
Why?

30:53.510 --> 30:55.270
Humans and demons walk different paths.

30:55.270 --> 30:56.590
Don't the people at the Sky Cavern

30:56.590 --> 30:58.200
also hate demons the most?

30:59.310 --> 31:00.110
That's right.

31:00.620 --> 31:02.340
We have an irreconcilable hatred for the demon clan.

31:02.340 --> 31:02.940
This point

31:03.570 --> 31:04.630
will never change.

31:05.000 --> 31:06.460
Then why did you let him go?

31:08.440 --> 31:09.240
Daoist Jiang,

31:09.660 --> 31:11.140
I truly admire you.

31:11.370 --> 31:12.360
It's just a pity that

31:12.360 --> 31:14.250
my master's great work is unfinished.

31:14.250 --> 31:15.860
As for you, you know too much.

31:15.960 --> 31:18.760
Keeping you alive would ultimately be a disaster.

31:18.880 --> 31:19.810
But don't worry,

31:20.910 --> 31:21.710
after you die,

31:21.990 --> 31:23.510
countless demons will soon

31:23.510 --> 31:25.180
come to accompany you in death.

31:25.180 --> 31:27.330
Dying for the cause of eliminating demons,

31:27.330 --> 31:29.860
you can be said to have died for a worthy cause.

31:30.270 --> 31:31.070
Daoist Jiang,

31:32.140 --> 31:33.740
I apologize for the offence.

31:36.860 --> 31:38.190
Disciple, quickly run!

31:42.240 --> 31:42.830
Master!

31:43.300 --> 31:43.880
Go!

32:16.880 --> 32:17.350
Master.

32:17.900 --> 32:19.500
Is everything taken care of?

32:19.560 --> 32:20.120
Yes.

32:22.670 --> 32:23.870
Xuanye made the move?

32:24.590 --> 32:25.850
Just as you predicted,

32:25.960 --> 32:27.880
Xuanye only destroyed his cultivation.

32:27.880 --> 32:29.280
I took care of the person.

32:29.890 --> 32:30.720
That senior brother of mine

32:30.720 --> 32:32.150
really has some skills.

32:32.800 --> 32:35.200
He can even turn a demon into a bodhisattva.

32:37.160 --> 32:38.160
This is the place.

32:41.480 --> 32:42.680
Come here, come here.

32:45.720 --> 32:46.310
Master.

32:46.750 --> 32:47.400
Manager.

32:47.890 --> 32:48.830
Have you been comfortable staying at my place

32:48.830 --> 32:49.960
these past two days?

32:50.940 --> 32:51.600
Yes, I have.

32:52.070 --> 32:53.600
How's your injury healing?

32:54.030 --> 32:55.080
All thanks to Master,

32:55.080 --> 32:56.210
it's almost healed.

33:05.500 --> 33:06.430
Is it beautiful?

33:08.050 --> 33:09.010
Yes, it is.

33:11.600 --> 33:12.720
This seems

33:13.220 --> 33:14.070
not very good.

33:24.720 --> 33:25.450
Throw him in.

33:25.840 --> 33:26.440
Yes.

33:27.270 --> 33:28.310
No, no, no!

33:28.310 --> 33:29.440
Master, Master!

33:29.590 --> 33:31.650
Why- why did you save me

33:31.680 --> 33:32.430
only to kill me now?

33:32.430 --> 33:32.890
Master.

33:33.270 --> 33:34.350
If you don't heal completely,

33:34.350 --> 33:35.270
will your demon powers and abilities

33:35.270 --> 33:36.070
be of any use to me?

33:36.070 --> 33:36.700
Throw him in.

33:36.700 --> 33:38.070
Master, please, I beg you!

33:38.070 --> 33:39.530
I've never harmed anyone.

33:39.590 --> 33:41.790
I've never done anything bad.

33:57.030 --> 33:57.590
Master,

33:58.160 --> 33:59.160
it's almost done.

34:00.780 --> 34:01.980
We just need one more.

34:13.000 --> 34:13.800
You're awake.

34:17.409 --> 34:18.870
Did I sleep for a long time?

34:20.510 --> 34:21.770
About a day and a night.

34:22.770 --> 34:24.000
That long?

34:25.880 --> 34:27.540
You must have been very tired.

34:28.510 --> 34:30.370
Have you been here the whole time?

34:33.550 --> 34:34.190
Banxia,

34:35.230 --> 34:37.010
do you know that when you sleep,

34:37.440 --> 34:38.699
you talk in your sleep?

34:39.400 --> 34:40.530
That's impossible.

34:41.040 --> 34:43.199
My mother said I sleep very quietly.

34:46.550 --> 34:47.350
Alright then.

34:56.449 --> 34:57.780
Are we leaving now?

34:58.920 --> 34:59.440
Yes.

35:00.580 --> 35:02.310
Are we going back to Guangping?

35:05.290 --> 35:07.220
You revealed my identity earlier.

35:07.550 --> 35:08.630
I'm afraid those with ill intentions

35:08.630 --> 35:10.150
have already taken note of it.

35:10.150 --> 35:10.950
Guangping...

35:11.370 --> 35:13.030
We can't go back there for now.

35:13.960 --> 35:15.120
I'm sorry.

35:16.540 --> 35:17.670
It's not your fault.

35:18.440 --> 35:19.920
I'm injured now,

35:20.230 --> 35:21.760
we can't stay here anymore.

35:21.960 --> 35:22.510
Let's first

35:22.510 --> 35:23.640
find a place to stay.

35:23.880 --> 35:25.080
When my injury heals,

35:25.320 --> 35:27.320
I'll accompany you back to Nanyang.

35:28.180 --> 35:30.380
You want to come back to Nanyang with me?

35:31.990 --> 35:32.880
No matter what,

35:33.690 --> 35:35.620
I owe your parents an explanation.

35:39.700 --> 35:41.230
Don't think about that now.

35:41.630 --> 35:43.160
Focus on recovering first.

35:46.830 --> 35:47.760
You're leaving?

35:48.280 --> 35:48.800
Yes.

35:50.630 --> 35:51.190
Xuanye,

35:51.700 --> 35:53.730
look, your old wounds haven't healed yet.

35:53.730 --> 35:54.760
People outside still believe

35:54.760 --> 35:56.430
you're the demon who harmed people.

35:56.430 --> 35:57.110
Besides here with me,

35:57.110 --> 35:58.310
where else can you go?

35:58.840 --> 35:59.570
Don't tell me

35:59.800 --> 36:01.860
you want to return to Ganshan Clinic.

36:02.480 --> 36:03.610
Don't worry, Uncle.

36:04.160 --> 36:05.200
I have no plans

36:05.320 --> 36:06.600
to return to Ganshan Clinic yet.

36:06.600 --> 36:07.290
Then,

36:08.230 --> 36:09.590
what are your plans now?

36:10.550 --> 36:12.410
Actually, I don't have any plans.

36:12.840 --> 36:14.240
I just want to find a place

36:14.400 --> 36:15.320
to rest quietly.

36:15.320 --> 36:16.360
Then stay here!

36:16.510 --> 36:17.070
Is there any place

36:17.070 --> 36:18.150
safer than here?

36:18.670 --> 36:19.920
Xuanye, do you find

36:20.920 --> 36:21.880
the Underground City

36:21.880 --> 36:23.210
uncomfortable to stay?

36:23.920 --> 36:25.280
If you have any thoughts,

36:25.280 --> 36:26.410
feel free to tell me.

36:27.030 --> 36:28.960
Thank you for your concern, Uncle.

36:29.190 --> 36:29.920
After all,

36:30.230 --> 36:31.190
I can't spend my whole life

36:31.190 --> 36:31.960
hiding here.

36:32.880 --> 36:33.440
Besides,

36:34.190 --> 36:35.990
I have some matters to attend to.

36:36.190 --> 36:36.920
That's fine.

36:38.750 --> 36:40.750
As you can see, our Underground City is

36:40.750 --> 36:41.510
dark and stuffy.

36:41.510 --> 36:43.590
It's indeed not suitable for recovery.

36:43.590 --> 36:45.120
You can leave if you want to.

36:45.290 --> 36:46.150
If you encounter

36:46.150 --> 36:47.070
any difficulties out there,

36:47.070 --> 36:48.670
don't hesitate to come to me.

36:49.170 --> 36:49.860
Xuanye,

36:51.320 --> 36:52.360
whether you're human

36:52.360 --> 36:53.070
or demon,

36:53.630 --> 36:54.490
remember this.

36:55.110 --> 36:56.760
I will always be your Uncle.

36:57.420 --> 36:58.030
And,

36:58.400 --> 36:59.970
those words I've told you before,

36:59.970 --> 37:01.770
you must keep them in your heart.

37:02.120 --> 37:03.180
You should believe

37:03.480 --> 37:05.060
that man can conquer nature.

37:05.060 --> 37:06.120
As long as you want,

37:06.840 --> 37:07.920
you have a choice.

37:09.150 --> 37:10.150
Thank you, Uncle.

37:10.480 --> 37:11.410
I will remember.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.190
Then we'll be going now.

37:17.820 --> 37:18.380
Go ahead.

37:24.470 --> 37:25.100
Master,

37:25.990 --> 37:28.050
are we just letting them go like this?

37:28.550 --> 37:29.610
What else can we do?

37:30.510 --> 37:32.040
Kill him right here and now?

37:33.190 --> 37:34.110
Don't forget,

37:34.630 --> 37:35.880
there are two Chief Constables from the government

37:35.880 --> 37:36.880
waiting outside.

37:37.920 --> 37:39.840
So what should we do next?

37:41.330 --> 37:42.550
Find the other panther demon

37:42.550 --> 37:43.680
as soon as possible.

37:44.670 --> 37:45.230
Yes.

37:51.340 --> 37:55.790
[Tomb of Old Friend, Chi Xue]

38:07.440 --> 38:09.040
I want to be alone for a while.

38:11.630 --> 38:13.560
Don't you need me to accompany you?

38:14.190 --> 38:14.760
No need.

38:32.420 --> 38:33.020
Come out.

38:43.670 --> 38:44.930
Do you understand now?

38:45.070 --> 38:46.070
You are not human,

38:46.590 --> 38:48.590
and you can never become one.

38:52.900 --> 38:55.030
You're the one who caused Chi Xue's death.

38:55.030 --> 38:55.590
No,

38:56.360 --> 38:58.230
I'm not the one who caused it.

38:58.590 --> 38:59.190
It was you.

38:59.480 --> 39:00.390
If you had realized earlier

39:00.390 --> 39:01.590
and returned with me,

39:01.760 --> 39:03.620
none of this would have happened.

39:06.250 --> 39:06.850
What?

39:07.380 --> 39:08.780
Are you seeking revenge?

39:09.760 --> 39:11.710
It's bad enough that you've accepted a thief as your father,

39:11.710 --> 39:13.750
now you want to kill your biological brother

39:13.750 --> 39:15.410
for the sake of a rabbit demon?

39:15.440 --> 39:16.640
Biological brother?

39:19.520 --> 39:20.120
Man Ying,

39:20.770 --> 39:21.980
for how long more do you want to remain

39:21.980 --> 39:23.240
stubborn and deluded?

39:23.280 --> 39:25.070
You see the human world as your home.

39:25.070 --> 39:26.800
Isn't the Carefree Land your home too?

39:26.800 --> 39:28.190
We've met so many times,

39:29.230 --> 39:31.110
have you ever asked about our father?

39:31.110 --> 39:33.710
Have you ever asked about the safety of the Carefree Land?

39:33.710 --> 39:35.590
I don't remember those things you mentioned.

39:35.590 --> 39:37.360
You will remember sooner or later.

39:37.360 --> 39:39.320
Or perhaps you've already remembered,

39:39.320 --> 39:40.180
but you're just

39:40.400 --> 39:42.330
unwilling to admit it to yourself.

39:47.760 --> 39:48.960
You are the clan leader

39:48.960 --> 39:49.960
chosen by Father.

39:50.480 --> 39:51.540
You have to go back.

39:51.590 --> 39:53.440
I don't want to be any clan leader.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.250
if you want to be,

39:54.250 --> 39:55.250
go be it yourself.

39:56.280 --> 39:57.150
Don't want to?

40:01.880 --> 40:03.410
You say you don't want to be?

40:04.570 --> 40:05.250
Do you know

40:05.280 --> 40:06.110
what the bloodline in you

40:06.110 --> 40:06.840
represents?

40:07.670 --> 40:08.870
Father is getting old

40:09.320 --> 40:10.770
and can't hold on much longer.

40:10.770 --> 40:12.430
The Carefree Herb withers year by year,

40:12.430 --> 40:13.800
yet we still have no solution.

40:13.800 --> 40:14.840
As the son of the clan leader

40:14.840 --> 40:16.320
of the Mystic Panther Clan,

40:16.320 --> 40:17.190
with extraordinary talent

40:17.190 --> 40:18.150
and powerful demon energy,

40:18.150 --> 40:19.230
guarding the Realm Gate,

40:19.230 --> 40:20.150
saving the Carefree Herb,

40:20.150 --> 40:21.320
and leading the entire clan

40:21.320 --> 40:22.880
are your responsibilities.

40:22.880 --> 40:24.540
You say you don't want to do it?

40:24.840 --> 40:27.040
I don't understand what you're saying.

40:32.030 --> 40:32.670
Xuanye.

40:37.840 --> 40:39.300
You really disappoint me.

40:40.200 --> 40:42.510
You're not worthy of being Mystic Panther Clan's leader,

40:42.510 --> 40:44.280
even more so of being my brother.

40:44.280 --> 40:45.190
From now on,

40:45.750 --> 40:46.590
your affairs

40:47.280 --> 40:48.680
are no longer my concern.

40:57.710 --> 40:58.920
Who was that person?

41:09.670 --> 41:10.700
It's indeed a bit messy.

41:10.700 --> 41:12.480
I haven't had time to clean up yet.

41:12.480 --> 41:13.150
But,

41:13.920 --> 41:15.150
the situation at Guangping

41:15.150 --> 41:16.380
is still unknown.

41:16.630 --> 41:18.160
So I can only trouble you two

41:18.820 --> 41:20.150
to recover here for now.

41:20.400 --> 41:21.150
It's fine.

41:21.710 --> 41:22.570
I just have to get some water

41:22.570 --> 41:23.860
and clean up a bit.

41:24.800 --> 41:25.660
Let me help you.

41:26.320 --> 41:26.840
No need.

41:26.860 --> 41:28.120
You're still injured.

41:28.230 --> 41:29.560
Aren't you injured too?

41:32.390 --> 41:33.520
You two should rest.

41:33.800 --> 41:34.400
I'll do it.

41:35.450 --> 41:36.230
Miss Sima,

41:36.250 --> 41:38.250
you shouldn't be working like this.

41:38.920 --> 41:41.050
We still have Youhuang here, don't we?

41:46.070 --> 41:47.600
Wipe more attentively.

41:47.630 --> 41:49.430
Do you even know how to do chores?

41:50.420 --> 41:52.460
Just sitting there making snide remarks,

41:52.460 --> 41:54.190
without even offering to help.

41:55.110 --> 41:56.310
Why should I help you?

41:56.710 --> 41:57.970
You're not my husband.

41:58.230 --> 41:58.960
Besides,

41:59.670 --> 42:00.800
if one day

42:00.800 --> 42:02.060
you become my husband,

42:02.480 --> 42:03.920
my official rank will be higher than yours,

42:03.920 --> 42:05.840
and my income will be more than yours.

42:05.840 --> 42:08.360
Naturally, you'll be the one doing the housework.

42:08.360 --> 42:10.390
Consider this as getting used to it in advance.

42:10.390 --> 42:11.850
Well, thank you very much.

42:13.100 --> 42:14.840
Take a rest and have some water.

42:15.090 --> 42:15.530
Here.

42:18.100 --> 42:19.900
You haven't done any work at all.

42:20.150 --> 42:23.550
Aren't you afraid of burning your tongue while having water?

42:25.150 --> 42:25.610
Banxia,

42:26.210 --> 42:27.190
I'll go to town later

42:27.190 --> 42:28.760
to buy some furniture and utensils for you,

42:28.760 --> 42:30.960
and also some rice and noodles for food.

42:30.960 --> 42:31.920
I can go.

42:32.100 --> 42:32.900
That won't do.

42:33.880 --> 42:35.000
There's nothing here.

42:35.000 --> 42:36.170
We need to buy a lot of things.

42:36.170 --> 42:37.790
You can't carry it all by yourself.

42:37.790 --> 42:39.050
I'll go with her later.

42:40.110 --> 42:41.000
Did you ask me?

42:42.990 --> 42:44.390
Well, I'm asking you now.

42:44.880 --> 42:46.010
Are you going or not?

42:46.550 --> 42:47.080
Alright.

42:47.280 --> 42:48.210
I'll go with you.

42:49.760 --> 42:50.280
Banxia,

42:50.670 --> 42:52.230
don't do the dirty work anymore.

42:52.230 --> 42:53.870
Leave it for us when we come back.

42:53.870 --> 42:55.200
Wait for us to come back.

42:56.390 --> 42:57.340
Hurry up.

42:57.550 --> 42:58.630
Stop dawdling.
